    "body": "### Bug Description\r\n\r\nSignal OSX v5.3.0 is not deleting disappearing messages in a group chat\r\n\r\n### Steps to Reproduce\r\n\r\nsetup group with 1 day disappearing but messages in the OSX app are not deleting even though they are on my iPhone.\r\n\r\nActual Result:\r\n\r\nmessages exist indefinitely it seems\r\n\r\nExpected Result:\r\n\r\nmessages older than 24 hours should disappear\r\n\r\n### Screenshots\r\n\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/240811/119769567-8790e780-be6f-11eb-9779-d56ee86246aa.png)\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/240811/119769610-99728a80-be6f-11eb-83d9-705c9045cb41.png)\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/240811/119769626-a1322f00-be6f-11eb-80cb-be94408da22f.png)\r\n\r\n### Platform Info\r\n\r\nSignal Version: OSX v5.3.0\r\n\r\nOperating System: OSX 11.2.1 (20D74)\r\n\r\nLinked Device Version:\r\n\r\niOS 5.12.0.51\r\n\r\n",
